  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.4.2\n\nCC SDK Version: (Worlds) 3.1.10\n\nDescription of the bug:\n\nAV Pro does not function out of the box when placed in the hierarchy of a project. In the Text Component field of the VRC URL Input Field component it defaults to none rather than the actual Text gameobject that is a child o the input field. This caused confusion as I was unable to input any text at all when spawning in the prefab. \n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\n\nBy spawning in the UdonSyncPlayer AvPro prefab asset.",
